        <mxCell id="lg1" value="&lt;b&gt;Edges — what changed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2D6A2D&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; solid green: exactly one controlled variable changes.&lt;br&gt;These five edges support direct causal attribution.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#B85450&quot;&gt;╌╌&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; dashed red: more than one variable changes. These&lt;br&gt;comparisons are architecture-family level and must be&lt;br&gt;qualified in the text, never reported as isolated ablations." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="106" width="500" height="106" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
