        <mxCell id="lg4" value="&lt;b&gt;S2&lt;/b&gt; has no incoming edge: it is a published-style reference architecture initialised from SAM alone, not a single-variable step from any node here. Compare it only with the other overlap-supervised models." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="318" width="500" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="proto" value="&lt;b&gt;Shared protocol, identical for all eleven runs.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Seed 42 · 60 epochs · AdamW, lr 1e-4, weight decay 0.05 · AMP float16 · gradient clipping 1.0 · 512 × 512 input · physical batch 2 × accumulation 8 = effective batch 16 · one GPU per run · validation disabled · &lt;font color=&quot;#B85450&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;load_from = None&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; (no run initialises from another) · every model scored with the same primary evaluator, &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;data/PIXray/annotations/test.json&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="800" width="1350" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

